WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.101
Momentum SGD and AdaGrad consistently beat plain
SGD, yet their theory is incomplete.

00:00:06.181 --> 00:00:11.701
For possibly non-convex losses, existing analyses
prove only weak guarantees,

00:00:11.781 --> 00:00:14.973
like subsequence or time-average convergence,

00:00:15.053 --> 00:00:18.900
not the almost-sure convergence practitioners rely on.
